<title>UK: Powergen confirms mulling Bewag bid.</title>
<headline>Powergen confirms mulling Bewag bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK electricity generator PowerGen confirmed it was considering a bid for a controlling interest in German utility Bewag, but said it had taken no action.</p>
<p>&quot;We are assessing the commerical opportunities presented by the Bewag privatisation which are, potentially, very interesting. But no final decision has yet been taken as to whether we will bid,&quot; said PowerGen spokesman Mike Pollak.</p>
</text>
